msgstr "Required action and remaining responsibility"

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid "Normal `TCIF` and `NDTR = 0`"
msgstr "Normal `TCIF` and `NDTR = 0`"

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid ""
"Memory-count completion only. Keep the request and frame borrowed. Software "
