#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid "Cancel, timeout or failure"
msgstr "Cancel, timeout or failure"

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid ""
"Preserve the first error and enter DRAINING; every error/cancellation reports"
