msgstr ""
"Preserve the first error and enter DRAINING; every error/cancellation reports"
" zero transferred bytes."

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid "Engine withdrawal"
msgstr "Engine withdrawal"

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid ""
"Clear TXDMAEN and DMA EN with readback before relying on serializer drain. A "
"failed clear retains the borrow."
msgstr ""
"Clear TXDMAEN and DMA EN with readback before relying on serializer drain. A "
"failed clear retains the borrow."

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid "Any I2SE enable attempt"
msgstr "Any I2SE enable attempt"

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid ""
"Observe `TXE = 1`, then a separate fresh `BSY = 0`, before clearing I2SE with"
" readback. An ignored enable write is still an attempted enable."
msgstr ""
"Observe `TXE = 1`, then a separate fresh `BSY = 0`, before clearing I2SE with"
" readback. An ignored enable write is still an attempted enable."

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid "No I2SE attempt"
msgstr "No I2SE attempt"

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid ""
"An accepted early setup failure may prove engine and reference withdrawal "
"without waiting for serializer flags."
msgstr ""
"An accepted early setup failure may prove engine and reference withdrawal "
"without waiting for serializer flags."

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid "Serializer already proved quiet"
msgstr "Serializer already proved quiet"

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid ""
"Preserve that proof across later cleanup retries; do not demand TXE again "
"from disabled I2S."
msgstr ""
"Preserve that proof across later cleanup retries; do not demand TXE again "
"from disabled I2S."

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid "Reference withdrawal"
msgstr "Reference withdrawal"

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid ""
"Clear stream configuration, addresses/count and flags; withdraw and prove "
"disabled, not pending and inactive vectors."
msgstr ""
"Clear stream configuration, addresses/count and flags; withdraw and prove "
"disabled, not pending and inactive vectors."

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid "Every proof joined"
msgstr "Every proof joined"

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid ""
"Detach provider references, release the original whole-frame loan, then "
"release-publish SETTLED as the final request access."
msgstr ""
"Detach provider references, release the original whole-frame loan, then "
"release-publish SETTLED as the final request access."

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid "Missing proof"
msgstr "Missing proof"

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:55
msgid ""
"Retain QUARANTINED storage. A drain-loop bound can return BUSY; timeout, TC "
"or a zero DMA count never substitutes for final access."
msgstr ""
"Retain QUARANTINED storage. A drain-loop bound can return BUSY; timeout, TC "
"or a zero DMA count never substitutes for final access."

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:157
msgid ""
"Acquire-observe SETTLED before reading the terminal result or reusing the "
"request and frame storage. Successful completion reports the full submitted "
"byte count. Error and cancellation report zero; a DMA count cannot establish "
"serialized audio bytes. Join external observers before their own storage is "
"reused. While stop has not closed admission, successful request settlement "
"keeps the initialized transmitter ready for another separately prepared "
"block; it does not release its physical role."
msgstr ""
"Acquire-observe SETTLED before reading the terminal result or reusing the "
"request and frame storage. Successful completion reports the full submitted "
"byte count. Error and cancellation report zero; a DMA count cannot establish "
"serialized audio bytes. Join external observers before their own storage is "
"reused. While stop has not closed admission, successful request settlement "
"keeps the initialized transmitter ready for another separately prepared "
"block; it does not release its physical role."

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:165
msgid ""
"With CK idle after prefill, DR cannot empty. Cancellation therefore retains "
"the loan until the product coordinates enough drain clocks for the actual TXE"
" and fresh BSY proof. This error drain may underrun or produce "
"partial/invalid audio; it does not promise a complete stereo frame. Keep the "
"first failure and restart later only at the left channel. Continuing "
"`service` or `stop` through the same owner can retry a stalled-clock cleanup "
"while its hardware/time history remains known."
msgstr ""
"With CK idle after prefill, DR cannot empty. Cancellation therefore retains "
"the loan until the product coordinates enough drain clocks for the actual TXE"
" and fresh BSY proof. This error drain may underrun or produce "
"partial/invalid audio; it does not promise a complete stereo frame. Keep the "
"first failure and restart later only at the left channel. Continuing "
"`service` or `stop` through the same owner can retry a stalled-clock cleanup "
"while its hardware/time history remains known."

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:173
msgid ""
"Observed reset, shared-gate/clock-profile loss or invalid time history while "
"borrowed permanently quarantines this instance and its loan. Restoring reset-"
"looking registers cannot establish prior final access. There is no reset or "
"recovery API that revokes that borrow. A product owns the response to an "
"unrecoverable controller/master failure."
msgstr ""
"Observed reset, shared-gate/clock-profile loss or invalid time history while "
"borrowed permanently quarantines this instance and its loan. Restoring reset-"
"looking registers cannot establish prior final access. There is no reset or "
"recovery API that revokes that borrow. A product owns the response to an "
"unrecoverable controller/master failure."

#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:179
msgid ""
"`stop` closes admission and requests cancellation. Repeat it after service "
"has proved any outstanding cleanup. Only successful transmitter stop returns "
"the selected pads/SPI2 personality and SPI2 gate; shared GPIOB/DMA1 gates "
"remain for Platform users. Failed stop retains every unfinished borrow and "
"owned effect."
msgstr ""
"`stop` closes admission and requests cancellation. Repeat it after service "
"has proved any outstanding cleanup. Only successful transmitter stop returns "
"the selected pads/SPI2 personality and SPI2 gate; shared GPIOB/DMA1 gates "
"remain for Platform users. Failed stop retains every unfinished borrow and "
"owned effect."

