#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:199
msgid ""
"The normal public-consumer source is [f407-i2s2-slave-"
"tx.c](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/io_evolution/consumers/f407-i2s2-slave-"
"tx.c). It links public construction and whole-frame ownership paths; linking "
"does not execute those calls. It is not an external clock source or a "
