#: docs/design/f407-i2s2-slave-tx.md:207
msgid ""
"The hardware sequence follows RM0090 Rev22 sections 28.4.6–28.4.8 and "
"10.3.13–10.3.14, with DS8626 electrical requirements and the pinned ES0182 "
"scope. The SPI-only BSY erratum workaround is not substituted for the I2S "
"shutdown sequence. Source identities are maintained in [the F407 reference "
"manifest](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/references.json)."
